  "bodyHash": "e7cb12f0a37d887e",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/15616ada48a6b7c8b74b64a220dbd6ebd6e361d0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"><br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a8d02e08b8066928bbb09565ac8c2e5337f25d99.png\"><br><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><strong>Project Babylon 是一個模組系列，致力於打造一個協同運作的 RPG 生態系統。正如其名，本模組為遊戲增添了大量護甲。</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a8d02e08b8066928bbb09565ac8c2e5337f25d99.png\"><br><br></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f7f9bfc707238d5f771b48e42c10b193ae105317.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"267\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>本模組新增了什麼？</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>28 套手工製作的 3D 護甲套裝。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">職業護甲進度系統。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">護甲套裝加成效果。<br><br></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3414c5657ade00d6149c0697cc76f0d2903bee86.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2044\" height=\"232\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">必要模組：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/project-babylon-materials\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Project Babylon - Materials.</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron's Spellbooks.</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geckolib.</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight.</a>&nbsp;<br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cf42bdfe52bf5f1505283de054cd7779a5552511.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"117\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><br>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epicfight-project-babylon-weapons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> Project Babylon Weapons</a> <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">（相同風格的武器）</span></p>\n<p><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a8ad1d230b8024e6136522ac323c1350c6ee3052.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"302\" height=\"110\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">武器宣傳片中展示的護甲在哪裡？就在這裡！:D</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">請問有 1.21.1 版本嗎？也許未來會有。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">請問會向下移植嗎？答案同上。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d9f50b27c02bef8209a8297e727ab44261ed4c08_0.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"478\" height=\"111\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><br>回報錯誤請在此留言：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252fchannels%252f955784714264932362%252f1507633160773439539\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.com/channels/955784714264932362/1482312386139652248</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">或在此：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252fchannels%252f1481294346933375100%252f1481325691718078484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.com/channels/1481294346933375100/1481325691718078484</a><br><br></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b412707b37e196f163b9b93962b0924b8af64820.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"189\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>推薦大家試試看我朋友製作的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod-rapier-moveset-addon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EpicFight Rapier Addon</a>，可獲得更多模型與內容！<br>也歡迎體驗由優秀團隊共同打造的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/ascendra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ascendra Modpack</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/horyzen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Horyzen Modpack</a>。</p>\n<p><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a2bc05122fec4f505ec4c72474e54599c2f6bc3d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2047\" height=\"223\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>感謝 Epic Fight 團隊打造出如此精彩的模組與 API。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">感謝 Yonchi Chikito 的支持。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">感謝 Epic Fight 社群讓此模組成為現實。</p>",
